---
name: two-reviewers
description: Collect one report from each of two reviewer agents within five minutes.
engine: 0.2.0-lab.1
roles: [lead, a, b]
---
"""
One lead agent asks two reviewer agents to review one proposal. Both reports
must be accepted before the session finishes. Collected means reports received,
not that the proposal has been approved. Progress updates do not replace reports.
"""
contract @1h => expired

"""
Give both reviewers the same proposal and context. Wait for both reports and
keep their findings separate when you summarize them.
"""
role lead

"""
Review the proposal independently. Report findings with evidence and
uncertainty; send progress notes only when they help the lead.
"""
role a

"""
Review the proposal independently. Report findings with evidence and
uncertainty; send progress notes only when they help the lead.
"""
role b

"""
The proposal to review and the question to answer.
"""
type start_review
  text: text(1..2000)

"""
Findings, evidence, scope checked and remaining uncertainty.
"""
type review
  text: text(1..2000)

"""
A short note on progress. It does not count as a review.
"""
type progress
  text: text(1..200)

"""
The lead sends the proposal to both reviewers.
"""
state new
  lead -> {a,b}: start_review() => reviewing

"""
Each reviewer reports within five minutes; progress notes may arrive meanwhile.
"""
state reviewing
  {a,b} -> lead: review() each @5m => collected | stalled
  event {a,b} -> lead: progress()

"""
Both reports arrived. The proposal is not approved until the lead says so.
"""
end collected

"""
A report is missing. The lead decides how to recover.
"""
end stalled
